  "solution": {
    "text": "Electronic configuration of Fe .\n$\\begin{aligned}\n{ }_{26} \\mathrm{Fe} & =[\\mathrm{Ar}] 3 d^6 4 s^2 \\\\\n\\mathrm{Fe}^{3+} & =[\\mathrm{Ar}] 3 d^5\n\\end{aligned}$\nNumber of unpaired electrons, $n=5$\nSpin only magnetic moment, $\\mu_s=\\sqrt{n(n+2)} \\mathrm{BM}$\n$\\begin{gathered}\n\\mu_s=\\sqrt{5(5+2)} \\\\\n\\mu_s=\\sqrt{35} \\\\\n\\mu_s=5.85 \\mathrm{BM} \\text { or } \\mu_s \\simeq 6 \\mathrm{BM}\n\\end{gathered}$",
